  "description": "YITAMOTOR factory brand packaging, Each cover is custom-built to ensure precise compatibility. Made from high-quality, commercial-grade vinyl that will not stretch, fade or crack.\nFitment\n2009-2018 Dodge Ram 1500\n2019-2024 Dodge Ram 1500 Classic\n2019-2026 Dodge Ram 1500 New Body Style\nNOTE:\nPlease measure your truck bed size or contact your dealer to confirm the correct model before ordering.\nCab size does not matter as long as you have the correct model and bed size.\nFeatures\nPrecise Fit:\nYITAMOTOR soft tri-fold tonneau cover is compatible with 5.7ft bed of\n2009-2018 Dodge Ram 1500, 2019-2024 Ram 1500 Classic & 2019-2026 New\nBody Style, Fleetside short bed without Rambox, Split Tailgate and Bed\nTrack System\nUnique Clamp Design: Features two clamp types, as the rear clamp is\ndesigned with a new release bolt to effectively prevent springing with\nstrong sealing during driving; Safety buckle connects with an aluminum\nsafety rope that’s light and will not easily deform\nEasy to Install & Use: No-drilling installation is a breeze with\ninstructions and mounting hardware included; Simply fold the cover back\nfor convenient cargo removal\nAll-around Protection: YITAMOTOR soft tri-fold tonneau cover is built\nusing reinforced UV & cold-resistant PVC materials that aptly guard\nyour cargo against rain, snow, and other harsh weather conditions\nSleek Styling: With a smooth, modern profile, this tonneau cover gives\nyour truck a clean look while protecting your cargo on every drive",
